{"ordinal":13224,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452983693314","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Death_06ca801","source":"Doctor: Я всего лишь врач...","target":"Doctor: Sunt doar un medic...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13225,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452983693313","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Death_0b7f53d","source":"Doctor: Нет, не стреляй, пожалуйста...","target":"Doctor: Nu, te rog, nu trage...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13226,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452983693312","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Ears_DontShoot_06175a3","source":"Doctor: Посмотрим, насколько нас ещё хватит.","target":"Doctor: Vom vedea cât mai putem rezista.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13227,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452979499017","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Ears_DontShoot_0dd52ae","source":"Doctor: А всё равно никто сдаваться не хочет.","target":"Doctor: Și totuși nimeni nu vrea să se dea bătut.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13228,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452979499016","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Ears_DontShoot_018fdb7","source":"Doctor: Невольно подумаешь: зачем тебе жизнь? Так невозможно. Это сплошные страдания.","target":"Doctor: Fără să vrei te întrebi: la ce-ți mai trebuie viața? Așa nu se poate. E numai suferință.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13229,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452979499015","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Ears_DontShoot_03414a3","source":"Doctor: За свою непростую жизнь насмотрелся на столько тяжёлых случаев...","target":"Doctor: În viața mea, care n-a fost ușoară, am văzut atâtea cazuri grave...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13230,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452979499014","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Photo_DontShoot_058bb5a","source":"Doctor: Вы простите, но почему так легко поверить в фото-признак от КЧС? Нет ощущения, что это наспех собранный признак для успокоения народа?","target":"Doctor: Mă iertați, dar de ce credeți atât de ușor în semnul de pe fotografii anunțat de Comitet? Nu vi se pare un semn stabilit în grabă, ca să liniștească lumea?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13231,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452979499013","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Photo_DontShoot_06f11a3","source":"Doctor: А почему вы верите в ауру? Вы действительно что-то почувствовали, когда нажали кнопку на аппарате?","target":"Doctor: Și de ce credeți în aură? Chiar ați simțit ceva când ați apăsat butonul aparatului?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13232,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452979499012","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Armpit_DontShoot_0f7ef74","source":"Doctor: И вот почему мне пришлось оттуда уйти.","target":"Doctor: De aceea a trebuit să plec de acolo.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13233,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452979499011","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Armpit_DontShoot_0d2967c","source":"Doctor: Вот чему меня научила больница.","target":"Doctor: Asta m-a învățat spitalul.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13234,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452979499010","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Armpit_DontShoot_03b8633","source":"Doctor: Никогда не спешите. Важно сохранять концентрацию и видение целой картины происходящего.","target":"Doctor: Nu vă grăbiți niciodată. E important să rămâneți concentrat și să vedeți imaginea de ansamblu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13235,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452979499009","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Eyes_DontShoot_088de20","source":"Doctor: Скажу так, я бы не надеялся.","target":"Doctor: Vă spun sincer, eu nu mi-aș face prea multe speranțe.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13236,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452979499008","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Eyes_DontShoot_03288eb","source":"Doctor: КЧС, конечно, должны взять всё в свои руки, но...","target":"Doctor: Desigur, Comitetul ar trebui să preia controlul, dar...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13237,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452975304711","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Eyes_DontShoot_0fccf89","source":"Doctor: Страшно, когда во времена бардака никто не контролирует происходящие ужасы.","target":"Doctor: E înfricoșător când, în vremuri de haos, nimeni nu ține sub control ororile care se petrec.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13238,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452975304710","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Hands_DontShoot_043ad1b","source":"Doctor: Но если вы ошибётесь, готовы ли жить с виной за убийство?","target":"Doctor: Dar dacă greșiți, sunteți pregătit să trăiți cu vina de a fi ucis pe cineva?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13239,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452975304709","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Hands_DontShoot_09a90f5","source":"Doctor: Лучше быть настороже, конечно.","target":"Doctor: Desigur, e mai bine să fiți atent.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13240,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452975304708","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Teeth_DontShoot_071b756","source":"Doctor: Когда вся эта история с Солнцем закончится, конечно.","target":"Doctor: Când se va termina toată povestea asta cu Soarele, desigur.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13241,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452975304707","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Teeth_DontShoot_021de3b","source":"Doctor: Задёшево, конечно. Раз ты помог мне.","target":"Doctor: Ieftin, desigur. Doar m-ai ajutat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13242,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452975304706","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Teeth_DontShoot_06a491a","source":"Doctor: Если хочешь, тебе тоже можем зубы починить.","target":"Doctor: Dacă vrei, îți putem repara și ție dinții.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-333.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13243,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452975304705","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Ears_Gun_01d65ed","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13244,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452975304704","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Ears_Gun_0602aaf","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13245,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452971110405","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Ears_Gun_0587b4e","source":"Doctor: Я столько времени работаю в больнице, и всё не могу привыкнуть к смерти. Какие бы условия ни были, а жить хочется.","target":"Doctor: Lucrez de atâta timp în spital și tot nu mă pot obișnui cu moartea. Oricare ar fi condițiile, tot vrei să trăiești.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-334.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13246,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452971110404","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Ears_Gun_0853b72","source":"Doctor: За столько времени в больнице, я уже смирился с конечностью жизни. Я теперь задаюсь вопросом, зачем же другие за неё держатся?","target":"Doctor: După atâta timp în spital, m-am împăcat cu faptul că viața are un sfârșit. Acum mă întreb de ce se agață alții de ea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-334.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13247,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452971110403","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Photo_Gun_0540ec5","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13248,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452971110402","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Photo_Gun_0c10c39","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13249,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452971110401","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Photo_Gun_0aea6d5","source":"Doctor: А воду перед телевизором заряжаете?","target":"Doctor: Încărcați și apa în fața televizorului?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-334.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13250,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452971110400","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Photo_Gun_04ada7b","source":"Doctor: Это поразительно. Вы верите в фото с аурой?","target":"Doctor: E uimitor. Credeți în fotografia cu aură?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-334.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13251,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452966916102","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Armpit_Gun_04bdaa5","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13252,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452966916101","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Armpit_Gun_045b796","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13253,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452966916100","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Armpit_Gun_0f01d54","source":"Doctor: Или лучше проверьте что-нибудь ещё. Стоит держать картину событий в голове целиком.","target":"Doctor: Sau, mai bine, verificați și altceva. Trebuie să păstrați în minte imaginea de ansamblu.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-334.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13254,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452966916099","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Armpit_Gun_0d03788","source":"Doctor: Хорошо подумайте, прежде чем делать такой серьёзный выбор.","target":"Doctor: Gândiți-vă bine înainte să luați o hotărâre atât de serioasă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-334.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13255,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452966916098","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Eyes_Gun_01f4b25","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13256,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452966916097","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Eyes_Gun_0055fa1","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13257,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452966916096","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Eyes_Gun_0903894","source":"Doctor: Но я и заключения бы не сделал, не та у меня специализация.","target":"Doctor: Dar nici eu n-aș pune un diagnostic, nu e specialitatea mea.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-334.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13258,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452962721801","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Eyes_Gun_0c2cc30","source":"Doctor: Интересно. Жаль не могу пронаблюдать, как развивалась ваша паранойя.","target":"Doctor: Interesant. Păcat că nu pot urmări cum a evoluat paranoia dumneavoastră.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-334.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13259,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452962721800","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Hands_Gun_0b9c8a6","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13260,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452962721799","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Hands_Gun_059ed93","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13261,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452962721798","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Hands_Gun_088200a","source":"Doctor: Подождите, но как по-вашему тогда выглядят руки человека?","target":"Doctor: Stați puțin, dar cum credeți că arată mâinile unui om?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-334.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13262,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452962721797","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Hands_Gun_0d6011a","source":"Doctor: Подождите, но как по-вашему должны выглядеть руки врача, который остался без санитарных условий?","target":"Doctor: Stați puțin, dar cum credeți că ar trebui să arate mâinile unui medic rămas fără condiții sanitare?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-334.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13263,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452962721796","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Teeth_Gun_001265d","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13264,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452962721795","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Teeth_Gun_0121a03","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13265,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452962721794","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Teeth_Gun_0e49ef0","source":"Doctor: А ты сейчас человека убьёшь...","target":"Doctor: Dar acum ești pe cale să omori un om...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-334.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13266,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452962721793","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Teeth_Gun_0c32df3","source":"Doctor: Ты делаешь ошибку, я людей лечу!","target":"Doctor: Faci o greșeală, eu îngrijesc oameni!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-334.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13267,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452962721792","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Teeth_Gun_0918b08","source":"Doctor: Подожди, что?","target":"Doctor: Stai, ce?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-334.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13268,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452958527496","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Ears_02a35a1","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13269,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452958527495","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Ears_0b26d2a","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13270,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452958527494","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Ears_00846b4","source":"Doctor: И раз я ещё жив, принимаете здравые решения.","target":"Doctor: Și, cum sunt încă în viață, înseamnă că luați decizii chibzuite.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13271,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452958527493","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Ears_02804d6","source":"Doctor: ...","target":"Doctor: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13272,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452958527492","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Ears_0bf5989","source":"Doctor: Хорошо, думаю, вы знаете, что делаете.","target":"Doctor: Bine, cred că știți ce faceți.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13273,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452958527491","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Photo_02f7431","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13274,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452958527490","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Photo_071bde3","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13275,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452958527489","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Photo_0bb6336","source":"Doctor: А что ты думаешь?","target":"Doctor: Dar tu ce crezi?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13276,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452958527488","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Photo_06572b9","source":"Doctor: Мне все говорили, что у меня необычная внешность.","target":"Doctor: Toată lumea îmi spunea că am o înfățișare neobișnuită.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13277,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452954333192","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Photo_0eefed1","source":"Doctor: ...","target":"Doctor: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
