{"ordinal":13279,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452954333190","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Photo_00a0977","source":"Doctor: Хорошо, без проблем.","target":"Doctor: Bine, nicio problemă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13280,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452954333189","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Armpit_0bd61e4","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13281,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452954333188","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Armpit_0304520","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13282,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452954333187","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Armpit_0f6fbfd","source":"Doctor: Это важно в мире, где не знаешь, помоешься ты завтра или неделю будешь копить грязь на теле, ха-ха.","target":"Doctor: E important într-o lume în care nu știi dacă te vei putea spăla mâine sau dacă vei aduna murdărie pe tine o săptămână, ha-ha.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13283,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452954333186","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Armpit_05447d5","source":"Doctor: Я стараюсь тщательно за собой ухаживать.","target":"Doctor: Încerc să am grijă de mine cât mai bine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13284,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452954333185","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Armpit_0db51c9","source":"Doctor: ...","target":"Doctor: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
