{"ordinal":13288,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452950138886","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Eyes_0ea4662","source":"Doctor: Но... увы.","target":"Doctor: Dar... din păcate.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13289,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452950138885","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Eyes_0994744","source":"Doctor: Казалось бы, два зрачка в одном глазу - как удобно!","target":"Doctor: Ai zice că două pupile într-un singur ochi sunt tare practice!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13290,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452950138884","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Eyes_03b4b4a","source":"Doctor: Я хуже из-за этого вижу.","target":"Doctor: Văd mai prost din cauza asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13291,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452950138883","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Eyes_03acf9f","source":"Doctor: ...","target":"Doctor: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13292,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452950138882","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Eyes_024d460","source":"Doctor: Вот что это значит.","target":"Doctor: Iată ce înseamnă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13293,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452950138881","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Eyes_00306a5","source":"Doctor: Не знаю, заметил ты или нет, но у меня поликория.","target":"Doctor: Nu știu dacă ai observat, dar am policorie.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":13294,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452950138880","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Doctor_Eyes_057f2d9","source":"Doctor: Хах, да, я покажу тебе свои глаза.","target":"Doctor: Ha, da, îți arăt ochii.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-335.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
